{% if formFiltroUsuario is defined and formFiltroUsuario|length > 0 %}

	{% set hasData = false %}

	{% for key, value in formFiltroUsuario.vars.data %}
		{% if value is not null and value != '' %}
			{% set hasData = true %}
		{% endif %}
	{% endfor %}

	<div class="card shadow mb-4 busqueda-avanzada {{ formFiltroUsuario.vars.submitted and hasData ? 'border border-primary' : '' }}">
		<a href="#collapseSearchUsuarios" class="d-block card-header py-3 collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-toggle="collapse" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseSearchUsuarios">
			<h6 class="m-0 font-weight-bold text-dark">
				{% if formFiltroUsuario.vars.submitted and hasData %}
					<i class="fas fa-search-plus me-3"></i>
					<b>Búsqueda Aplicada</b>
				{% else %}
					<i class="fa fa-search me-3"></i>Buscar
				{% endif %}
			</h6>
		</a>
		<div class="collapse" id="collapseSearchUsuarios">
			<div class="card-body">
				{{ form_start(formFiltroUsuario, {attr: {"novalidate":"novalidate"}}) }}
				{{ form_widget(formFiltroUsuario) }}
				<div class="row mt-2">
					<div class="col">
						<button class="float-end btn btn-sm btn-primary" style="margin-left:15px;">Buscar</button>
						<a class="btn btn-sm float-end btn-light" href="{{ path('equipo_historial_index', {'id': equipo.id}) }}">Quitar Filtros</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				{{ form_end(formFiltroUsuario) }}
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
{% endif %}
